-- HR — payroll, performance, learning, benefits
-- Monthly payroll runs, reviews and review cycles, goals/OKRs, training, benefits and enrolments, tax declarations and policy acknowledgements.
-- Generated by scripts/db/generate.ts — edit config.ts / types.ts, then re-run.
